# Health regen: kill four zombies, let one of the rest hit the player down to 20, see the red edge, kill it, and see health come back to 100.
# GOD MODE only keeps the player alive once health is 20; it does not stop regen. The proof is the low screen and the regen.
expect hud.health 100
fight_until hud.objective 2 LEFT 2400
tap reload
until hud.reloading false 120
face 0 0
until hud.health 20 1200
debug GOD MODE
shot low
state low
fight_until hud.objective 1 LEFT 600
until hud.health 100 600
shot healed
expect player.dead false
